[{"client_msg_id":"A6F84F2E-CF6D-41A8-8F95-3270B497D639","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"cocやVSCodeの拡張を作る場合は拡張側でコマンド作るってことですね","ts":"1615288442.008800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HMQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"895ce5ed-6872-4fe5-99de-744cb9c761cb","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"説明ありがとうございます :bow:","ts":"1615287321.007000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DfI6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b89d66c6-9d74-42d7-9189-488705002629","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"\u003c@U7TMPGWJ0\u003e そうですね。今は状況違うかもしれませんが、lspの仕様上各コマンドに必要な引数や結果出力方法を定義する方法がなかったため、個別のプラグインを実装して実行するという方法をとっています。こうなると他のエディタでSQLの実行なんかができないから良くないのは理解しているのですが、lsp側に柔軟に各Execute CommandとCodeActionの入出力を定義するプロトコルがないと根本的な解決策がなく。","ts":"1615287165.006700","edited":{"user":"U80CX6XDZ","ts":"1615287185.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lkLon"}]},{"client_msg_id":"444ff027-c1a6-426f-9142-5fb0d4bb3e65","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あー、sqlsの。コードアクションや関連したコマンドは `sqls.vim` や `sqls.nvim` を入れてそのプラグインのコマンド `:SqlsXXXX` から実行してくださいってことですかね。vim-lsp で `:LspCodeAction` を実行するとアクションのリストが出るのでこのまま実行できるのかなーなんて思った次第でしたが。自己解決しました。","ts":"1615285147.004100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H6I=c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96ac12cc-5bf5-45c2-9592-0f3900f055c3","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"\u003c@U80CX6XDZ\u003e さんにお伺いしたかったのですが sqls についてです。 sqls のコードアクション(関連したコマンド)はクライアント側で実装する必要があるというものなのでしょうか？","ts":"1615282834.003900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=0b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a92dd84-cb8a-440b-a595-c85e00b19a37","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"なんとなくカスタマイズが大事なタスクランナー系なのにdocsないし、マッピングも設定してくるしであんまり好きじゃないタイプでしたね・・・\nタスクランナー系もREPL系もいっぱいあるからこれじゃなくていい感があって・・・","ts":"1615281017.003700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JBlA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D1380197-0FD1-47E0-BFB1-1AA9FF71B5FC","type":"message","user":"U80CX6XDZ","text":"なんとなくターミナルで実行中のものを表示したりREPLで逐次実行ができるのがウリなのかなーと思ってました。vim-terminator","ts":"1615280804.002400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1sM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d3ac897-8c7d-492b-b520-8fbe249d3627","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/erietz/vim-terminator\u003e\nquickrun ぽさ","ts":"1615248132.423100","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: erietz/vim-terminator","id":1,"title":"erietz/vim-terminator","title_link":"https://github.com/erietz/vim-terminator","text":"Run your code in an output buffer or a vim terminal very conveniently - erietz/vim-terminator","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11425271?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/erietz/vim-terminator","original_url":"https://github.com/erietz/vim-terminator"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/9vy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7fa2fc94-3744-42fa-b662-0a959f7f3b47","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"一応できますね","ts":"1615247154.422800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jkOi7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1ae44ec-962e-45ba-9f58-a474495eea7c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"defxって画像のプレビューできるんだ","ts":"1615246515.422300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0/iN"}]}]
